# Design reference material — the .dc.html prototypes, their runtime, and the
# asset folders they load from. All of it now lives outside the project, in
# `krub brand/reference/`, since the spec is written and nothing needs
# measuring against them any more.
#
# These rules stay as a guard: if a copy is ever dragged back in to check a
# value, it will not end up in a commit. The leading slashes matter — they
# anchor to the repository root so `public/assets` and `public/icons` are
# unaffected.
Home.dc.html
Design System.dc.html
support.js
/assets/
/icons/
/uploads/

